### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### Swagger UI (открыть в браузере)
# http://localhost:8080/swagger/index.html

### Swagger JSON
GET http://localhost:8080/swagger/doc.json

###
### Сценарий 1: заказ (транзакция — order + items + total)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": 1,
  "items": [
    { "product_id": 1, "quantity": 1 },
    { "product_id": 2, "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

###
### Сценарий 2: атомарное обновление email
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/customers/1/email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new.ivan@example.com"
}

###
### Сценарий 3: новый продукт (атомарная вставка)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_name": "Монитор 27",
  "price": 25000.00
}

###
### Справочно: клиенты и товары (после миграций с seed)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/customers

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
